  "releaseNotes": "### Connect an external agent to a conversation\n\n- Open a conversation's menu and choose Connect Agent to invite an external MCP client. The agent can use the conversation's tools under its existing permissions and approval rules.\n- Follow the agent's tool calls in the original conversation. Start or end a task, or revoke an individual connection from the conversation.\n- Use the same MCP setup to access Widgets directly. Clients that support tool-list updates can see tools appear as they become available.\n- Improve screenshot capture in the built-in browser, including when the page has just changed.",
